---
description: Bulgarian full male name — given name, PATRONYMIC middle name, surname (Иван Петров Георгиев). The middle name is not optional decoration: it is the father's given name with the -ов / -ев suffix, it appears on every Bulgarian identity document, and a two-part Bulgarian name is an incomplete one. It is drawn from the same suffixed pool as the surname, which is exactly right — a Bulgarian patronymic and a Bulgarian surname are the same kind of word.
generator: tdc
locale: bg
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="bg.person.male.firstName"/>
  <gen name="m" type="template" value="bg.person.lastName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="bg.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.m}} ${{p.l}}</data>
